# Copy this file to .env for local development. For GitHub Pages, set these
# as repo Variables/Secrets under Settings > Secrets and variables > Actions
# instead — see DEPLOYMENT.md. For Netlify, set these as Site environment
# variables instead — see NETLIFY_DEPLOYMENT.md.

# Required when deploying to GitHub Pages: GitHub Pages is static-file-only
# and can't proxy /api/* to a separate backend the way Netlify could, so the
# frontend must call the backend directly at its own address, e.g.:
# VITE_API_URL=https://bright-learners-api.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=

